# Provisional Protocol Application

This scope computes the duration of the provisional application period for the fishing opportunities protocol.

```catala
declaration scope ProvisionalProtocolApplication:
  input protocol_start content date
  input protocol_end content date
  input provisional_start content date
  input payment_deadline content date
  output provisional_duration content duration
```

## Provisional Application Duration

The duration of the provisional application is calculated from the provisional start date until the end date of the Protocol period.

```catala
scope ProvisionalProtocolApplication:
  date round down
  definition provisional_duration equals
    protocol_end - provisional_start
```